/**
 * Icono glyph library.
 *
 * Every glyph is authored on a 24x24 grid and described with raw SVG path data
 * (`d`). Strokes are applied at render time by the variant engine in
 * `variants.js`, so a glyph stays style-agnostic and can be recoloured, reweighted
 * and re-scaled into hundreds of variants without touching this file.
 *
 * Shape of an entry:
 *   { slug, name, tags[], d[] }
 *
 *   slug  stable machine identifier, used to build icon ids (`<slug>--v<index>`)
 *   name  human label shown in the browser UI
 *   tags  search keywords (lowercase, no spaces)
 *   d     one or more path strings rendered in order
 */

